Subject: [PATCH] can: rcar_canfd: Extract rcar_canfd_global_{,de}init()
References: bsc#1258210
Patch-mainline: 6.18.46
Git-commit: fa5f4ec8fff8bc587a2cbf7101303306e045c11f

[ Upstream commit fa5f4ec8fff8bc587a2cbf7101303306e045c11f ]

